,"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"東門遂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m102-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"襄仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001268","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p102","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-139","person_id":"cbr-p001268","surfaces":["東門遂","襄仲"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","quote":"十八年二月，文公卒。文公有二妃：長妃齊女爲哀姜，生子惡及視；次妃敬嬴，嬖愛，生子俀。俀私事襄仲，襄仲欲立之，叔仲曰不可。襄仲請齊惠公，惠公新立，欲親魯，許之。冬十月，襄仲殺子惡及視而立俀，是爲宣公。哀姜歸齊，哭而過市，曰：『天乎！襄仲爲不道，殺適立庶！』市人皆哭，魯人謂之『哀姜』。魯由此公室卑，三桓彊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","quote":"十八年，宣公卒，子成公黑肱立，是爲成公。季文子曰：『使我殺適立庶失大援者，襄仲。』襄仲立宣公，公孫歸父有寵。宣公欲去三桓，與晉謀伐三桓。會宣公卒，季文子怨之，歸父奔齊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","quote":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p102","quote":"太史公曰：余聞孔子稱曰『甚矣魯道之衰也！洙泗之閒齗齗如也』。觀慶父及叔牙閔公之際，何其亂也？隱桓之事；襄仲殺適立庶；三家北面爲臣，親攻昭公，昭公以奔。至其揖讓之禮則從矣，而行事何其戾也？"}],"rationale":"第57段文公卒後襄仲殺適立庶，第78段史墨回述魯文公卒、東門遂殺適立庶，按同一卷的具體事件暫定同指；不是把遂或襄仲作全域匹配。尚未核底本及現代研究。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","text":"十八年二月，文公卒。文公有二妃：長妃齊女爲哀姜，生子惡及視；次妃敬嬴，嬖愛，生子俀。俀私事襄仲，襄仲欲立之，叔仲曰不可。襄仲請齊惠公，惠公新立，欲親魯，許之。冬十月，襄仲殺子惡及視而立俀，是爲宣公。哀姜歸齊，哭而過市，曰：『天乎！襄仲爲不道，殺適立庶！』市人皆哭，魯人謂之『哀姜』。魯由此公室卑，三桓彊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001250","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001250","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001263","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"子惡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"視","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001265","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"敬嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001266","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"子俀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001267"